      "content": "But you just said they are \"difficult to justify.\" That sounds like you're saying most new gun laws are basically unconstitutional now. If the Supreme Court is moving toward this \"history and tradition\" test, isn't it basically true that most modern regulations are on shaky ground? Be real, isn't the legal consensus shifting toward a near-total protection of the 2nd amendment?",
